{"id":"251691cede4cbc3e","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness.md","title":"Bernardi’s Conditional Fixed-Point Uniqueness","display":"lem-bernardi-uniqueness — Bernardi’s Conditional Fixed-Point Uniqueness","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness","aliases":["89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-bernardi-uniqueness — Bernardi’s Conditional Fixed-Point Uniqueness","depends_on":["[[89-df-modalized]]","[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","[[89-df-dotted-box]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-bernardi-uniqueness — Bernardi’s Conditional Fixed-Point Uniqueness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"138d8c34e0370a6b\" href=\"?note=138d8c34e0370a6b\" title=\"89-df-modalized\">89-df-modalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95a48b6ae42f7e48\" href=\"?note=95a48b6ae42f7e48\" title=\"89-df-dotted-box\">89-df-dotted-box</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"437e16026e9e0691\" href=\"?note=437e16026e9e0691\" title=\"89-df-finite-frame-rank\">89-df-finite-frame-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\setminus(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\cup\\{p\\})\">\\(q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\setminus(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\cup\\{p\\})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;=A[p:=q]\">\\(A&#39;=A[p:=q]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 为 dotted box；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为子公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bernardi\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A\\land p)\\;\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\land\\Box^+(q\\leftrightarrow A&#39;)\n\\to(B\\leftrightarrow B[p:=q]))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bernardi\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A\\land p)\\;\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\land\\Box^+(q\\leftrightarrow A&#39;)\n\\to(B\\leftrightarrow B[p:=q]))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 122；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>用有限 GL 完全性，设某模型中有满足前件而某子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 不保持的最低秩世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>。前件在所有后继传播。底和不被重命名的字母不会失配；布尔失配下降到一个构件。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\">\\(p,q\\)</span> 失配，当前两条方程使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,A&#39;\">\\(A,A&#39;\\)</span> 失配；模态化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是其他字母和盒公式的布尔组合，所以最终找到一个失配盒 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box D\">\\(\\Box D\\)</span>。每个后继秩更小，全部对应子公式由极小性保持；两盒于是同真同假，矛盾。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=p\">\\(B=p\\)</span> 得原书 Lemma 11 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leftrightarrow q\">\\(p\\leftrightarrow q\\)</span>。此唯一性引理不使用不动点存在定理，可用于后续存在性证明而无回环。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modalized","status":"resolved","id":"138d8c34e0370a6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-box]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite-frame-rank","status":"resolved","id":"437e16026e9e0691","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\setminus(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\cup\\{p\\})","display":false},{"tex":"A'=A[p:=q]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bernardi\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A\\land p)\\;\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\land\\Box^+(q\\leftrightarrow A')\n\\to(B\\leftrightarrow B[p:=q]))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"p,q","display":false},{"tex":"A,A'","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"B=p","display":false},{"tex":"p\\leftrightarrow q","display":false}],"bytes":1772,"backlinks":[{"id":"426d9ae12ef39fe8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"03089c3cefed4872","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6c6cad39792d5f33","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"判据与唯一性：[[89-df-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]；[[89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality]] → [[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]。"}],"outgoing":["138d8c34e0370a6b","48f7a8aeae4eecb4","95a48b6ae42f7e48","71b4f56d6213ff7c","437e16026e9e0691","b47f1c